5.4 Route Summary
Route	Method	Purpose
/	GET	Renders index.html
/generate	POST (form)	Full pipeline → comic_preview.html
/generate-comic/json	POST (JSON)	Full pipeline → JSON layout + PDF path
/export-success	GET	Renders export_success.html
/test-image	POST	Direct image generation for isolated testing
5.5 Development Notes
Each service function is independently callable — that is precisely why /test-image exists: it verifies the diffusion stage without spending Gemini quota.
generate_image() sanitises the prompt into a safe filename, so panel paths are reproducible and filesystem-safe.
save_pdf() places one panel per page, image above narration, so printed output stays readable.
Error handling uses FastAPI's HTTPException plus try-except blocks covering API failures and JSON decode errors.
